# Two rows of y whose spans both start on 2026-01-01.
=== options reprint
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

input y: int

version v
  cite s
  governs 2026..
  known 2026-01-01
  y = 1 governs 2026..2026-06
  replace y = 2 governs 2026..
